            <div xml:id="d269">

                <pb facs="0371" n="259" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg259"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/411</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-30T16:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 30, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 26, 9 a.m. Department approves your course of action and desires that
                    you be guided by your best judgment.</p>
                <p>For your information—the quoted portion of Department’s April 23, 5 p.m., was
                    sent by cable to Legations at Panama, Guatemala, and Nicaragua, with the
                    statement that it was for their information and whatever public use they might
                    deem desirable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
